    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d928">

                <pb facs="1020" n="1008" sameAs="frus:frus1940v03/pg1008"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">390D.11/205: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Turkey</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >MacMurray</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Ankara</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1940-11-23T12:00:00+02:00">November 23,
                            1940—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received 12:33 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>210. Embassy’s telegram number 163, October 7, 6 p.m., and despatch No. 1590,
                    November 8.<anchor n="67" xml:id="d928-f1"/> I took up this matter yesterday
                    with the Foreign Minister and expressed the hope that notwithstanding the urgent
                    international problems now preoccupying him he would be able to look into this
                    question soon. He said that he hoped that he would be able to do so in the near
                        future.<anchor n="68" xml:id="d928-f2"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">MacMurray</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d928-f1" n="67" xml:id="d928-f1-content">
                <p>Latter not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d928-f2" n="68" xml:id="d928-f2-content">
                <p>No further action, however, was taken by the Turkish authorities on this proposed
                    agreement.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
